                    {
                        "sense_id": "26abd07d-f8ba-3326-9322-19c30272e7a9",
                        "entry_id": "66e840a8-ae7a-3cbe-98e2-1aa666b8b09d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not capable of being justified or excused."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af51c952-2ba3-487b-8e8e-5955defc13b5",
                                "sense_id": "26abd07d-f8ba-3326-9322-19c30272e7a9",
                                "text": "Mr. Elliot's frank statement that \"sloth and untidiness are indefensible\" is a sign that the task will be tackled with vigour."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b8a2187-89a2-4b09-bcf3-70a4bdbdcf61",
                                "sense_id": "26abd07d-f8ba-3326-9322-19c30272e7a9",
                                "text": "The president evidently intends to follow his own misguided calculus. A decision to withdraw would be indefensible. It is important to understand why and to consider what we need to do next."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "87959a4d-e055-4795-bb0c-0246fae6470e",
                                "sense_id": "26abd07d-f8ba-3326-9322-19c30272e7a9",
                                "text": "Killing civilians is indefensible, whether done by Hamas or Israel [title]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
